    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "THIS SUPERANNUATION FUND TRUST DEED is made on the date specified in Schedule 3 by the Trustee named in Schedule 3.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                6,
                28,
                1115,
                79
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "WHEREAS:",
            "block_bbox": [
                4,
                108,
                155,
                131
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A.The Trustee has agreed to act as the first Trustee of the Fund named in Schedule 3, which is established and is to be maintained as an indefinitely continuing superannuation fund (the.'Fund') for the purpose of providing superannuation benefits for Members.",
            "block_bbox": [
                1,
                162,
                1113,
                240
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B.The Trustee has agreed to accept the trusts constituted under this Deed and to undertake the liabilities, duties and obligations imposed upon the Trustee by this Deed and by the laws applicable in the jurisdiction to which it is subject.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                269,
                1112,
                348
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "NOW THIS DEED WITNESSES AS FOLLOWS ",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                375,
                552,
                399
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1.This Deed will be governed and interpreted and will take effect in accordance with the Relevant Law.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                430,
                1113,
                482
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.Except to the extent that any interests of Members or Beneficiaries of the Fund are otherwise affected or circumscribed by the Relevant Law or by this Deed, the Fund will be.vested in, controlled by and administered by the Trustee.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                510,
                1116,
                591
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.This Deed will be interpreted in accordance with the Rules.",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                619,
                747,
                645
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4.If the Relevant Law does not exclude the operation of the rule against perpetuities in relation to those trusts, the trusts created by this Deed will terminate on the first to occur of:",
            "block_bbox": [
                0,
                671,
                1120,
                725
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "of this Deed; or \n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                73,
                750,
                1121,
                805
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b)the date on which this Deed is terminated in accordance with its provisions.",
            "block_bbox": [
                75,
                831,
                1007,
                859
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        }
    ],
